          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "reliably remains to be tested."
        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "A sufficiently detailed instruction-following rubric can represent $O$,"
        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "$\\Gamma$, and $\\mu$ and produce the same claim labels. Our position is that"
        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "these conditions should be stated explicitly and checked alongside each"
        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
