        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "be compared with methods that have access to the same evidence and task"
        },
        {
          "kind": "ol-cm-change ol-cm-change-c",
          "text": "conditions, measuring reliability, the ability to explain errors, and cost."
